Cyberpunk style: A small child with glowing neon-blue eyes sits cross-legged on a cluttered floor surrounded by dismantled vintage computers and scattered circuit boards. The room is bathed in purple and teal ambient light from holographic displays floating nearby. The child reaches toward an old CRT monitor that projects a swirling vortex of digital penguins made of electric particles. Tangled cables snake across the floor like vines, connecting ancient beige PC towers to futuristic crystalline servers. Through a rain-streaked window, a Southeast Asian jungle landscape merges with a glittering cityscape. The child's expression is one of pure wonder and determination, their small hands crackling with tiny sparks of data. Reflections of code streams dance across their face, creating an intimate moment of technological curiosity and youthful ambition in a world where old and new technology collide.
